    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d445">

                <pb facs="0518" n="414" xml:id="pg414"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.00 Revolutions/340: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-08-26T18:00:00-04:00">August 26, 1932—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>69. Your telegram No. 90 of August 22, 2 p.m. Please report promptly details of
                    any case which may arise involving an application of the proclamation in
                    question to an American citizen or interest. Also cable the date of the law
                    establishing the monopoly and transmit a copy of the law by mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
